            <ArticleTitle>Perspectives on some recent studies on RAMPs.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>105-12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/978-1-4614-2364-5_9</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This book on RAMPs covers a number of aspects on the biology of RAMPs. However, due to the uniqueness of some recent studies, they were not covered under a general title. Therefore, in this chapter, we describe three recent studies wherein RAMPs were found to be important players in cancer, hypertension and asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
